  <section class="bdc__section bdc__section--soft" id="verdict" aria-labelledby="verdict-heading">
    <div class="bdc__wrap">
      <div class="bdc__section-head bdc__section-head--center">
        <span class="bdc__eyebrow">Quick Verdict</span>
        <h2 class="bdc__h2" id="verdict-heading">The Short Answer: Recovery Routine or Dual-Mechanism Comfort</h2>
        <p class="bdc__intro">Brio Sport vs DualTech is not a forced winner. It is a lifestyle and body-fit decision: do you want the recovery-style Positive Posture Brio Sport, or the modern dual-mechanism Positive Posture DualTech 4D?</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bdc__two">
        <article class="bdc__card">
          <div class="bdc__card-body">
            <h2>Choose the Brio Sport if:</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>You want a recovery-focused massage chair designed for active lifestyle routines.</li>
              <li>You want adjustable deep-tissue massage feel.</li>
              <li>You want Sport4D massage, heated rollers, full-body compression, and focused sessions.</li>
              <li>You want specialized programs such as Warm Up, Cool Down, Stretch, Compression, and recovery-style sessions.</li>
              <li>You want focus areas such as neck and shoulders, low back, glutes, and IT bands.</li>
              <li>You want L-track coverage from the back of the head down to the glutes and hamstrings.</li>
              <li>You want a taller user range up to 6 feet 5 inches.</li>
              <li>You like easy-clean upholstery and a chair positioned around recovery and stress reset.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="bdc__card">
          <div class="bdc__card-body">
            <h2>Choose the DualTech 4D if:</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>You want the more modern-looking Positive Posture chair.</li>
              <li>You like the idea of two specialized massage mechanisms working together.</li>
              <li>You want an upper 4D mechanism for the neck, upper back, and lumbar regions.</li>
              <li>You want a lower RotoTech mechanism focused on glute massage.</li>
              <li>You want body-contoured SL-track coverage from neck to glutes.</li>
              <li>You want intelligent body scan, bi-directional foot rollers, full-body air massage, dual-zone heat, True Zero Gravity, Bluetooth speakers, tablet remote, USB charging, ambient lighting, removable back pad, and adjustable headrest pillow.</li>
              <li>You care about space-saving placement with only 3 inch wall clearance.</li>
              <li>You want a top-selling chair with a strong modern value story.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="bdc__summary-line">The Brio Sport is the more recovery-focused active-lifestyle chair. The DualTech 4D is the more modern dual-mechanism everyday comfort chair. The best decision depends on your body fit, recovery routine, lower-body needs, room space, and preferred massage feel.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

