          <h3>Brio Sport Feature Blocks</h3>
          <article class="bdc__feature"><h4>1. Sport4D Massage Mechanism</h4><p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Adds a more athletic, adjustable massage personality for recovery-focused routines.</p><p><strong>Demo cue:</strong> Test light and deeper settings to see whether the pressure feels productive without feeling too intense.</p></article>
